                                                "sense_id": "cac06df1-ed91-3e5f-a499-c47d430812b4",
                                                "text": "If someone normally burns in 10 minutes with no sunscreen, then a sunscreen with sun protection factor 20 will provide protection for up to 20 × 10 = 200 minutes."
